938
01:28:37,000 --> 01:28:40,640
<i>Hey, what the hell are you doing?
Fuck off.</i>

939
01:28:53,120 --> 01:28:55,120
<i>- Little Vilma...
- Mommy?</i>

940
01:28:55,280 --> 01:28:58,760
<i>Now she's alone with that horrible woman.</i>

941
01:28:59,400 --> 01:29:02,840
<i>It's probably her fault
that he started using drugs.</i>

942
01:29:03,080 --> 01:29:05,440
Don't make it harder than it is.
Come on, Vilma.

943
01:29:05,600 --> 01:29:07,680
No! You can't take her! Let go!

944
01:29:07,840 --> 01:29:11,840
<i>She's horrible. She's ice-cold.
She's calculating.</i>

945
01:29:12,000 --> 01:29:14,120
- Come on, Vilma.
- Let go of her!

946
01:29:14,280 --> 01:29:16,040
You want to be with Mom.

947
01:29:16,200 --> 01:29:18,400
Vilma lives with her grandmother now.

948
01:29:18,560 --> 01:29:21,000
No, Vilma! No!

949
01:29:21,160 --> 01:29:22,840
Vilma!

950
01:29:29,560 --> 01:29:31,960
<i>A video is spreading on social media</i>

951
01:29:32,120 --> 01:29:37,800
<i>of Helga Gregorius doing coke
two weeks after her husband's overdose.</i>

952
01:29:38,000 --> 01:29:44,200
<i>- How do you feel about that?
- I can relate, actually.</i>

953
01:29:44,440 --> 01:29:47,400
<i>Is it a breakdown,
or is it meant as a tribute to him?</i>

954
01:29:47,560 --> 01:29:52,040
<i>- Both, I hope.
- Have you read anything else by him?</i>

955
01:30:00,760 --> 01:30:02,040
<i>Helga!</i>

956
01:30:21,120 --> 01:30:26,720
Hey! I'm outside.
Should I buzz the intercom?

957
01:30:26,880 --> 01:30:28,200
Okay.

958
01:30:28,480 --> 01:30:32,640
Yeah, yeah. I'll buzz. Okay.

959
01:30:42,920 --> 01:30:44,240
<i>- Hello?
- It's me.</i>

960
01:30:44,480 --> 01:30:46,760
<i>- I'm opening.
- Thanks.</i>

961
01:31:09,800 --> 01:31:13,480
- Just go. Get out of here.
- Please, you said you needed me.

962
01:31:13,720 --> 01:31:16,920
Let me in, for fuck's sake. Talk to me.

963
01:31:23,000 --> 01:31:25,680
- I'm sitting right here.
- You don't know what I need.

964
01:31:25,840 --> 01:31:28,200
- Then tell me!
- I'm telling you. Go away!

965
01:31:28,360 --> 01:31:30,320
I don't believe you.

966
01:31:34,280 --> 01:31:37,520
Is it that fucking guy
at the costume party - Martin?

967
01:31:37,680 --> 01:31:41,400
- Do you have something going on?
- Don't talk to me like that.

968
01:31:41,560 --> 01:31:44,440
You know what? You mean nothing to me.

969
01:31:44,600 --> 01:31:48,080
- Nothing.
- You're just like Olivia and Patrik.

970
01:31:48,240 --> 01:31:52,120
You use people
and dump them when you don't need them.

971
01:31:52,280 --> 01:31:55,880
Klas, you were going to play Patrik
in Patrik's film!

972
01:31:56,040 --> 01:31:59,480
You stood there saying you loved him!
Fuck you!

973
01:31:59,640 --> 01:32:02,960
You just wanted to fuck his wife!
You wanted his life!

974
01:32:03,120 --> 01:32:06,520
- Take care.
- Get out of here!

975
01:33:06,280 --> 01:33:08,040
What are you doing?

976
01:33:08,200 --> 01:33:10,160
I've been trying to call you.

977
01:33:10,400 --> 01:33:11,720
You climbed up?

978
01:33:14,240 --> 01:33:17,840
Everyone's worried about you.
Patrik's mother and Lena.

979
01:33:18,480 --> 01:33:23,000
They... asked me to talk to you.

980
01:33:23,160 --> 01:33:25,880
- And you agreed to that?
- No.

981
01:33:26,680 --> 01:33:28,560
I'm here for your sake.

982
01:33:28,720 --> 01:33:32,200
I'm afraid you'll hurt yourself.

983
01:33:36,120 --> 01:33:39,280
They want to take Vilma from me, so...

984
01:33:39,800 --> 01:33:43,080
- So what?
- What the hell do you think?

985
01:33:43,240 --> 01:33:49,000
Since Patrik died, everything's been
upside down, and you're right.

986
01:33:49,160 --> 01:33:53,480
I've thought about hurting myself.
I want to be alone.

987
01:33:53,640 --> 01:33:57,680
I'm free. But it doesn't feel like it.

988
01:34:04,280 --> 01:34:07,920
- Were you at the costume party?
- No.

989
01:34:09,320 --> 01:34:11,400
Klas said you were.

990
01:34:12,480 --> 01:34:15,320
I don't know what Klas
has gotten into his head.

991
01:34:16,720 --> 01:34:18,760
Did you see us just now?

992
01:34:20,480 --> 01:34:21,480
I won't say anything.

993
01:34:26,080 --> 01:34:29,640
We'll talk about it later,
because I need to rest now.

994
01:34:32,200 --> 01:34:33,320
Window or door?

995
01:34:41,840 --> 01:34:45,880
Maybe I'll come
to your clinic some time this week.

996
01:34:46,040 --> 01:34:50,560
I can't sleep at all.
I guess it's PTSD or something.

997
01:34:52,800 --> 01:34:56,960
- I can't be your doctor anymore.
- Why not?

998
01:34:58,400 --> 01:35:00,640
- Why?
- Because...

999
01:35:07,840 --> 01:35:11,240
No, no. Gabriel.

1000
01:35:11,960 --> 01:35:13,360
Sorry.

1001
01:35:15,480 --> 01:35:17,680
- Well...
- It's okay.

1002
01:35:29,080 --> 01:35:33,160
It was Klas's child I aborted, wasn't it?

1003
01:35:33,880 --> 01:35:35,480
What?

1004
01:35:36,960 --> 01:35:38,640
What are you talking about?

1005
01:35:46,240 --> 01:35:48,440
You didn't want to leave Patrik.

1006
01:35:50,240 --> 01:35:53,360
You just didn't want people to find out
you'd cheated.

1007
01:35:53,760 --> 01:35:55,040
What do you mean?

1008
01:35:55,200 --> 01:35:58,800
I should've listened to what Patrik said,
what everyone says about you.

1009
01:35:58,960 --> 01:36:03,520
You lie, you manipulate people
to get what you want.

1010
01:36:03,720 --> 01:36:08,000
You're a junkie and a bad mother.
No one is trying to take Vilma from you.

1011
01:36:08,160 --> 01:36:12,640
She's not here because you don't care.
You care only about yourself.

1012
01:36:12,880 --> 01:36:15,720
- I want you to leave.
- No.

1013
01:36:16,600 --> 01:36:20,800
You lied to me the whole time.
Everything was a lie. Isn't that right?

1014
01:36:20,960 --> 01:36:25,440
Patrik was right. He was innocent.
A good dad, but you wanted him dead.

1015
01:36:25,600 --> 01:36:29,320
You asked me to kill him.
You made me do it.

1016
01:36:29,880 --> 01:36:33,000
And now you're acting
like you're sad about it.

1017
01:36:33,160 --> 01:36:36,520
- Now you pretend...
- No, no, no!

1018
01:36:42,040 --> 01:36:43,160
What the fuck?

1019
01:36:43,320 --> 01:36:48,160
No, Gabriel! Please!
Please, drop the knife.

1020
01:36:48,760 --> 01:36:52,160
- What do you want from me?
- I want the truth.

1021
01:36:52,400 --> 01:36:54,720
Drop the knife and
I'll tell you the truth.

1022
01:36:56,440 --> 01:36:57,440
Okay?

1023
01:37:05,120 --> 01:37:06,800
Please, sit down.

1024
01:37:20,160 --> 01:37:22,920
I don't know whose child it was.

1025
01:37:24,000 --> 01:37:27,200
I was sleeping with Patrik and Klas.
How would I know?

1026
01:37:27,360 --> 01:37:30,920
Either way, I didn't want another child.

1027
01:37:31,800 --> 01:37:34,880
I was going to leave Patrik, but...

1028
01:37:36,760 --> 01:37:39,880
That night he brought me up to the suite,

1029
01:37:40,040 --> 01:37:43,720
and wanted to do some crazy sex thing.

1030
01:37:43,880 --> 01:37:47,600
I don't know...
It was the last straw for me.

1031
01:37:47,840 --> 01:37:51,200
I snapped and I screamed out
what I hadn't dared say before.

1032
01:37:51,360 --> 01:37:54,440
That I was afraid of him,
that I wanted to leave but didn't dare.

1033
01:37:54,600 --> 01:37:58,640
Things I got the courage from you to say,
Gabriel.

1034
01:37:58,800 --> 01:38:02,720
But strangely enough, he didn't take it
the way I thought he would.

1035
01:38:02,880 --> 01:38:09,280
He broke down and said we should go home
and talk about everything, about us.

1036
01:38:10,440 --> 01:38:12,840
But then he touched me and...

1037
01:38:13,120 --> 01:38:16,200
Now, I don't think
he meant anything by it.

1038
01:38:16,360 --> 01:38:20,280
But right then, in that moment,
I couldn't handle it, so I ran.

1039
01:38:22,200 --> 01:38:28,760
I'd decided I was going to meet Klas, but
I already knew then that it was over...

1040
01:38:32,200 --> 01:38:36,160
I left Klas there. And you know what?

1041
01:38:36,360 --> 01:38:39,440
Right then, in that moment,

1042
01:38:39,680 --> 01:38:44,160
I felt almost hopeful.

1043
01:38:45,520 --> 01:38:47,720
I was proud.

1044
01:38:49,760 --> 01:38:56,080
Then I got back to the castle,
and I thought Patrik had killed himself.

1045
01:38:56,240 --> 01:39:00,160
No! Let go of me!

1046
01:39:00,320 --> 01:39:03,600
Because of what I'd said,
that it was my fault.

1047
01:39:03,880 --> 01:39:10,080
I can't even look
my own daughter in the eye anymore.

1048
01:39:10,320 --> 01:39:13,640
For fuck's sake, you fucking psycho!

1049
01:39:13,880 --> 01:39:17,760
I was finally going to leave him,
and then you took that from me!

1050
01:39:18,000 --> 01:39:21,480
No. You said...

1051
01:39:22,880 --> 01:39:24,960
You said you wanted him to die.

1052
01:39:25,120 --> 01:39:28,640
You said it. You said it!
That's what you said!

1053
01:39:28,920 --> 01:39:34,400
It was just a thought... something I said.
How the hell could you think I meant that?

1054
01:39:34,680 --> 01:39:38,600
Did he rape you? Or was that also
just something you said?

1055
01:39:40,120 --> 01:39:42,120
I've never lied to you, Gabriel.

1056
01:39:44,400 --> 01:39:47,600
- How can I believe you?
- Why can't you?

1057
01:39:47,760 --> 01:39:52,400
Is it because I drink and take pills
and had an abortion and cheated

1058
01:39:52,560 --> 01:39:56,120
and because the media and people
I don't even know think I'm a junkie

1059
01:39:56,280 --> 01:39:58,360
and a bad fucking mother?

1060
01:39:58,640 --> 01:40:04,760
Okay, so I am. Does that mean
I couldn't have been raped?

1061
01:40:05,560 --> 01:40:12,120
Maybe I played on your feelings for me,
Gabriel, and I do that sometimes.

1062
01:40:12,360 --> 01:40:17,480
And I'm sorry! But it was because
I thought you understood me,

1063
01:40:17,640 --> 01:40:20,840
that you were the only one
who saw me!

1064
01:40:21,000 --> 01:40:24,520
But you see me the exact same way
everyone else does.

1065
01:40:24,680 --> 01:40:28,280
Either like a saint or a fucking whore.

1066
01:40:29,520 --> 01:40:32,680
What if I'm both?
Or what if I'm neither?

1067
01:40:32,840 --> 01:40:36,640
What if I'm also a complex, real person?

1068
01:40:36,880 --> 01:40:39,800
Like you. Like Patrik.

1069
01:40:40,040 --> 01:40:45,160
I've done so many things wrong.
And I'm absolutely not perfect.

1070
01:40:45,320 --> 01:40:48,360
But I loved Patrik,
and I hated him too.

1071
01:40:48,520 --> 01:40:53,120
- That doesn't add up. It's not logical.
- According to whose fucking logic?

1072
01:40:53,280 --> 01:40:56,280
What the hell do you want me
to say to you, Gabriel?

1073
01:40:57,480 --> 01:41:00,160
We can discuss truth and lies
all we want,

1074
01:41:00,320 --> 01:41:03,640
but you choose
whether you believe me or not.

1075
01:41:04,240 --> 01:41:07,800
But the only thing
we know in this moment is

1076
01:41:07,960 --> 01:41:10,880
that right now
you're standing there with a knife,

1077
01:41:11,040 --> 01:41:14,240
threatening a woman who's been
your patient, who's a mother,

1078
01:41:14,400 --> 01:41:19,560
and you killed her husband.
That's the truth, Gabriel.

1079
01:41:56,560 --> 01:41:59,040
<i>The consequences of love are horrific.</i>

1080
01:42:00,760 --> 01:42:02,960
<i>What more can I say?</i>

1081
01:42:03,440 --> 01:42:05,240
<i>My words mean nothing.</i>

1082
01:42:06,440 --> 01:42:08,720
<i>And I have no one to talk to.</i>

1083
01:42:08,960 --> 01:42:11,400
<i>From earth you came,
to earth you shall return.</i>

1084
01:42:11,560 --> 01:42:13,880
<i>From earth you came,
to earth you shall return.</i>

1085
01:42:14,040 --> 01:42:16,600
<i>From filth you came,
to filth you shall return.</i>

1086
01:42:16,760 --> 01:42:19,160
<i>From filth I came,
to filth I shall return.</i>

1087
01:42:19,320 --> 01:42:21,680
<i>My dreams are violent.
I dream of love.</i>

1088
01:42:22,240 --> 01:42:23,920
<i>I dream of love.</i>

1089
